      "effect": "1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuners\nYou can target 1 opponent's monster in this card's adjacent column, or 1 card in your opponent's Spell & Trap Zone that is 2 columns away from this card's; banish that card. If this card is placed in the Spell & Trap Zone as a Continuous Spell: You can send 1 \"Angelechy\" card from your Deck to the GY. You can only use each of the preceding effects of \"Angelechy Castellan\" once per turn. While this card is treated as a Continuous Spell, each player can only activate 1 card or effect per Chain."
